# Base URL of the Baking-Lyrics backend API (copy this file to .env.local to override).
# Defaults to /api/v1 on the same origin. In development Vite proxies /api to
# http://localhost:9090 (see vite.config.js). The backend has no CORS support,
# so in production serve the API under the same origin (reverse proxy /api to
# the backend) instead of pointing this at another host.
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
